{"surah":1,"ayahs":["بِسْمِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رَّحْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">مَٰ</span>نِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">حِي</span>مِ","ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">عَٰ</span>لَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">مِي</span>نَ","ٱ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رَّحْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">مَٰ</span>نِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">حِي</span>مِ","<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">مَٰ</span>لِكِ يَوْمِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دِّي</span>نِ","إِيَّاكَ نَعْبُدُ وَإِيَّاكَ نَسْتَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عِي</span>نُ","ٱهْدِنَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صِّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">رَٰ</span>طَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُسْتَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">قِي</span>مَ","صِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">رَٰ</span>طَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ أَنْعَمْتَ عَلَيْهِمْ غَيْرِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَغْضُوبِ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_necessary\">ضَّآ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">لِّي</span>نَ"]}